%% SilverFile orchestration. Rendered to docs/graph.png; the README shows the same diagram.
%% Regenerate: npx -p @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli mmdc -i docs/graph.mmd -o docs/graph.png -b white -s 2
flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> O[Orchestrator<br/>picks the next step from state]

    subgraph agents ["Agents: each returns to the Orchestrator, Review with any revision requests"]
        direction LR
        I[Intake<br/>talks to the taxpayer]
        subgraph docs [" "]
            direction TB
            X[[Document Extraction<br/>one parallel branch per document]] --> AGG[Aggregate<br/>reducer merges the branches]
        end
        R[Eligibility & Rules<br/>cites policy.md]
        C[Computation<br/>every number from MCP tax_math]
        V[Review / Audit<br/>rechecks the whole return]
        H[/Human in the loop<br/>staff decide on the dashboard/]
    end

    O -->|intake incomplete| I
    O -->|documents pending| X
    O -->|rules not evaluated| R
    O -->|lines not computed| C
    O -->|not reviewed| V
    O -->|escalation, review limit<br/>or loop guard| H
    agents -.-> O
    agents ~~~ END([Draft 1040-SR with provenance])
    O -->|draft ready or stopped| END

    style agents fill:#f6f8fa,stroke:#d0d7de
    style docs fill:none,stroke:none
